E. Challenges Faced: 
I found it difficult to finalize the scope and decide how many pages and user 
roles were actually needed without over-complicating. Structuring the 
sitemap and wireframe in a logical flow also took a few attempts to get right. 


F. Learning Outcomes: 
I learnt how to break down a big project idea into clear modules, how 
wireframe and navigation flow(sitemap) are made before coding. I also 
understood how to set up a proper GitHub repository with a README for 
maintaining project structure.
